## 4. 补货模拟接口

### 4.1 触发补货模拟

**请求**：

```text
POST /api/v1/stores/{store_id}/replenish/simulate
```

**请求体**：

```json
{
  "fixture_ids": ["uuid"],
  "strategy": "reorder_point",
  "override_lead_time_days": 7.5,
  "include_ramadan": true,
  "simulation_date": "2026-10-14"
}
```

**策略枚举**：

| strategy | 说明 |
|---|---|
| `reorder_point` | 基于再订货点 |
| `fefo` | 先过期先出 |
| `ramadan_pre` | 斋月前置补货 |
| `auto` | 系统自动选择 |

**响应**：

```json
{
  "simulation_id": "uuid",
  "store_id": "uuid",
  "simulation_date": "2026-10-14",
  "strategy": "reorder_point",
  "results": [
    {
      "facing_id": "uuid",
      "fixture_label": "F-001",
